#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:5
#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:37
#: 193717b226754beeafae922486e3f2ca 44f8d593751942a8a50f2fbe5903e6bf
msgid "MAUCH Power Monitor"
msgstr "MAUCH 电源监视器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:7
#: 907000948bd64472809345e78f4e2ea5
msgid ""
"This page explains how to set up the `MAUCH <https://www.mauch-"
"electronic.com/#webs-bin-563c137b7add4cb229080f55>`__ power monitors "
"HS-050-xx\\* (50A), HS-100-xx (100A) and HS-200-xx\\* (200A) to measure "
"battery voltage and current consumption.  For information on purchasing, "
"please see the `MAUCH Electronics <https://www.mauch-"
"electronic.com/apps/webstore/>`__ website."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何设置 `MAUCH <https://www.mauch-electronic.com/#webs-"
"bin-563c137b7add4cb229080f55>`__ 电源监视器 HS-050-xx\\*（50A）、HS-100-xx（100A）和 "
"HS-200-xx\\*（200A）以测量电池电压和电流消耗。购买信息请参阅 `MAUCH Electronics "
"<https://www.mauch-electronic.com/apps/webstore/>`__ 官网。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:12
#: e9aa0c416dd14e9eb5f4d2ad798fd6cb
msgid ""
"(\\*xx is the indicator for: LV = Vow Voltage 2-6S, maximum 28V HV = High "
"Voltage 4-14S, maximum 60V)."
msgstr "（\\*xx 表示：LV = 低电压 2-6S，最大 28V；HV = 高电压 4-14S，最大 60V）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:17
#: c8d88503650945ca9d21ac3a3999a399
msgid ""
"These monitors use a `hall-effect "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hall_effect>`__ current sensor. These are "
"much more accurate across the whole current range than sensors using a shunt"
" resistor, consume very little power, and are unaffected by operating "
"temperature."
msgstr ""
"这些监视器使用 `霍尔效应 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hall_effect>`__ "
"电流传感器。与使用分流电阻的传感器相比，霍尔传感器在整个电流范围内精度更高，功耗极低，且不受工作温度影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:24
#: 8e4c00f51c0442c4884f1abbbb993202
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:26
#: 11680c5f0b2e499e8c3a92ac7faa739e
msgid ""
"`MAUCH <https://www.mauch-electronic.com/#webs-"
"bin-563c137b7add4cb229080f55>`__ has a number of PMs, which are compatible "
"with Pixhawk, APM, Pixhawk lite, AUAV-X2, DroTek und CUAV Pixhack. The "
"sensors boards are capable of delivering 100A continuous current for "
"HS-100-V2 and 200A for the HS-200-V2 (without any time limit). The maximum "
"burst current is 1200A@25'C and 800A@85'C for 1 second."
msgstr ""
"`MAUCH <https://www.mauch-electronic.com/#webs-"
"bin-563c137b7add4cb229080f55>`__ 拥有多款电源模块，兼容 Pixhawk、APM、Pixhawk "
"lite、AUAV-X2、DroTek 和 CUAV Pixhack。传感器板可为 HS-100-V2 提供 100A 持续电流、为 HS-200-V2"
" 提供 200A 持续电流（无时间限制）。最大浪涌电流为 25°C 时 1200A、85°C 时 800A，持续 1 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:39
#: fbcf623fef8d45cbad6ce80b0d2a9460
msgid "**Sensor Board:**"
msgstr "**传感器板：**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:41
#: 4d4db5216c5d48b4ac8121dfdd6a3211
msgid ""
"Current sensor is a “true hall sensor” up to 50A (HS-050-LV/HV),100A "
"(HS-100-LV/HV) or 200A (HS-200- LV/HV)"
msgstr ""
"电流传感器为「真霍尔传感器」，额定电流分别为 50A（HS-050-LV/HV）、100A（HS-100-LV/HV）或 "
"200A（HS-200-LV/HV）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:43
#: 904b34ea2afd43eebb05ceb8e4cb02e2
msgid ""
"Continuous current 200A for HS-200-xx and 100A for HS-050-xx / HS-100-xx"
msgstr "HS-200-xx 持续电流 200A，HS-050-xx / HS-100-xx 持续电流 100A"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:45
#: 6281cb48626f417c9eed5722409f6221
msgid "Over current: 1200A@25'C or 900A@85'C (all sensors)"
msgstr "过电流：25°C 时 1200A 或 85°C 时 900A（所有传感器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:46
#: 882e70a80e9f4bb9add03a7683ead6dd
msgid ""
"Ultra-low noise power supply (LP2985-4.0) for current sensor and offset "
"shifting circuit."
msgstr "为电流传感器和偏移移位电路提供超低噪声电源（LP2985-4.0）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:48
#: 3a3558f5151e4c8c9282a3e628a07c0c
msgid "Microchip MCP601 operational amplifier for offset shifting."
msgstr "Microchip MCP601 运算放大器用于偏移移位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:49
#: a80d265f7d3b46ccadb237fb53864339
#, python-format
msgid ""
"LiPo voltage measurement with 1% resistor divider in factor 9:1 (LV) and "
"18:1 (HV)"
msgstr "LiPo 电压测量使用 1% 精度分压电阻，比例为 9:1（LV）和 18:1（HV）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:51
#: 1b3629e15d7248bca003d4da36931dae
msgid ""
"Supply voltage to Pixhawk / APM = 5.35V/3A (with attached LV- or HV-BEC)"
msgstr "向 Pixhawk / APM 提供的供电电压 = 5.35V/3A（配合 LV 或 HV BEC）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:53
#: d1bc1408bccd46d4ac9d43adbf0383b0
msgid ""
"Bright LED as power on indicator (blue LED for 200A / green LED for 100A / "
"yellow for 50A)"
msgstr "明亮 LED 作为上电指示灯（200A 为蓝色 LED / 100A 为绿色 LED / 50A 为黄色 LED）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:55
#: 7e95a354e975473c8e821a326a86e754
msgid ""
"2x10cm / AWG12 cable soldered to current sensor as standard size (Up to AWG8"
" possible)."
msgstr "标准规格：2x10cm / AWG12 电缆焊接至电流传感器（最大支持 AWG8）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:58
#: 099ad3a0d6db44e9bdcac803803a9489
msgid "**Low Voltage: 2-6S BEC**"
msgstr "**低电压：2-6S BEC**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:60
#: 8bfa510671bb43ddb78070fae6d2b8eb
msgid "Input 2-6S LiPo / max. 28V"
msgstr "输入 2-6S LiPo / 最大 28V"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:61
#: 49030f375b37400aa0297b7f162e8ab5
msgid ""
"Output 5.35V / 3A -> +/- 0.05V –> Ripple 10mV (0.2%) at 1.5A output current."
msgstr "输出 5.35V / 3A -> +/- 0.05V -> 在 1.5A 输出电流时纹波 10mV（0.2%）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:63
#: 94e1bef31a8f47c389742ca029fcf79c
msgid ""
"Input wrong polarity protection, as well as Panasonic FM 220uF/35V input "
"capacitor to prevent burn out."
msgstr "具备输入极性保护，以及 Panasonic FM 220uF/35V 输入电容以防止烧毁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:65
#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:73
#: 2f22c97fbee844e298a34d6d6ab0346d 740b077150c849fcb210e8380b041eab
msgid "10cm 4 pole silicone cable to sensor board with DF-13 connector."
msgstr "10cm 4 芯硅胶电缆连接传感器板，配 DF-13 连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:66
#: b8890e2a6d06473ea9c942dfecc0a350
msgid "47mm x 18mm x 11mm / 8g with cables and shrinking tube."
msgstr "47mm x 18mm x 11mm / 8g（含电缆和热缩管）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:68
#: ea0415aece914275b3d31ada70d485cb
msgid "**High Voltage: 4-14S HYB-BEC**"
msgstr "**高电压：4-14S HYB-BEC**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:70
#: 80b357e3084546eb990446de8d963289
msgid ""
"Input: 4S-14S LiPo / max, 60VOutput: 5.3V / 3A -> +/- 0.05V -> Ripple 80uV "
"(0.00008V) at 1.5A output current."
msgstr ""
"输入：4S-14S LiPo / 最大 60V；输出：5.3V / 3A -> +/- 0.05V -> 在 1.5A 输出电流时纹波 "
"80uV（0.00008V）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:72
#: 205b77fe33fa47ef84ea89a5d979321e
msgid "Panasonic FM input capacitors to prevent burn out."
msgstr "Panasonic FM 输入电容以防止烧毁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:74
#: 7913cef91d55424685a017352a70b293
msgid "53mm x 21mm x 14mm / 20g with cables and shrinking tube."
msgstr "53mm x 21mm x 14mm / 20g（含电缆和热缩管）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:76
#: 9e8b56d73b1c4fc59036920d1ee8dd66
msgid ""
"There is more information about hall current sensors and these PMs in this "
"blog post: `Safety First: 100A & 200A Hall Sensor with BEC for Pixhawk / APM"
" <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/safety-first-100a-200a-hall-sensor-mit-"
"bec-for-pixhawk-apm>`__."
msgstr ""
"关于霍尔电流传感器和这些电源模块的更多信息，请参阅此博客文章：`Safety First: 100A & 200A Hall Sensor with "
"BEC for Pixhawk / APM <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/safety-"
"first-100a-200a-hall-sensor-mit-bec-for-pixhawk-apm>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:80
#: 99913e0159784e69b137292e90a0c483
msgid "Connecting the PM to an autopilot board"
msgstr "将电源模块连接到飞控板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:85
#: 962c318b60244a4d866e91a740d30cb3
msgid "MAUCH Power Module, BEC, PixhawkWiring"
msgstr "MAUCH 电源模块、BEC、Pixhawk 接线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:88
#: a56ec66fef424c36bbe30f3cb5e1731c
msgid "Setup through Mission Planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:90
#: f339649fb9e34ac8a2a3d42c57ce443b
msgid ""
":ref:`Power Monitor Configuration in Mission Planner <common-power-module-"
"configuration-in-mission-planner>` explains in more detail how to configure "
"a Power Module and get low battery alerts from Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Mission Planner 中的电源监视器配置 <common-power-module-configuration-in-"
"mission-planner>` 详细介绍了如何配置电源模块并从 Mission Planner 获取低电量警报。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:94
#: 2fb46dcd91cc4724aadac7a7192b7a40
msgid ""
"The MAUCH PM's are not available in the Sensor selection list (at time of "
"writing) so you will need to select **Other** and perform a manual "
"calibration. Because the PM uses hall sensors you can ignore the "
"recommendation to calibrate the sensor at >3Amps."
msgstr ""
"MAUCH 电源模块目前（撰写本文时）未出现在传感器选择列表中，因此需要选择**其他**并手动校准。由于电源模块使用霍尔传感器，可以忽略在 >3A "
"时校准传感器的建议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:99
#: b40fc0bcd3394fb0a021a0c2ac81c459
msgid ""
"Each sensor board comes with an final test result, which indicates the "
"calibration values for voltage and current measurement."
msgstr "每块传感器板均附带最终测试结果，其中包含电压和电流测量的校准值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:102
#: cfa027761fbf420b910310f69e8564a8
msgid ""
"On the *Mission Planner*\\ ’s **INITIAL SETUP \\| Optional Hardware \\| "
"Battery Monitor** screen set the **Sensor** to **Other**."
msgstr "在 *Mission Planner* 的 **初始设置 \\| 可选硬件 \\| 电池监视器** 界面，将**传感器**设置为**其他**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:104
#: c4ac685d55524aad9b714982eacbe08b
msgid ""
"Enter the voltage divider from the final test result and press **TAB** or "
"click out of the field. Then the *calculated battery voltage* should be "
"within a few millivolt of the actual battery voltage."
msgstr "输入最终测试结果中的分压系数并按 **TAB** 键或点击字段外部。此时*计算出的电池电压*应与实际电池电压相差几毫伏以内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:108
#: 845f6f90d2204c57a2102b4754affcc2
msgid ""
"Enter the **Amperes per volt** from the final test result (A/V) and press "
"**TAB** or click out of the field."
msgstr "输入最终测试结果中的**每伏安培数**（A/V）并按 **TAB** 键或点击字段外部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mauch-power-modules.rst:114
